# Frontend v5

- **Stack:** React 19, Vite, React Router 7, plain JSX (not TypeScript)
- **API client:** `src/api/index.js` — all fetches go through here
- **Auth:** `src/context/AuthContext.jsx` — token in `localStorage` as `auth_token`
- **Routes:** `/`, `/athlete/:key`, `/ranking`, `/events`, `/compare`, `/favorites`, `/login`
- **API base:** `VITE_API_BASE_URL` (empty in prod — nginx proxies `/api`)

## Rules

- Read [API.md](../../API.md) for endpoint shapes and time/date edge cases
- Parse times defensively; display apostrophe format from API
- Debounce athlete search (min 2 chars per API)
- Do not call backend directly on a hardcoded host in prod — use relative `/api`
- Match existing CSS in `src/index.css`; no new UI framework
